  "player_roster_v2_review": "Inspected all five source sheets, five runtime all-frame previews and shared-baseline lineup. Distinct anatomy, right-facing poses, transparent backgrounds, no baked text, matching per-character portraits cropped from idle. Minor generated pose/detail variation remains; runtime dimensions and pixel properties are checked separately.",
  "skill_sprite_review": "Inspected five source sheets, cleaned teal cast sheet, all four frames of each of the ten character and ten VFX strips in per-color previews, plus all five icons in skills-overview.png. No baked letters or scenery; right-facing character poses retain v2 identities. Cyan/cream effects distinguish charge/slash, envelopes, stamp/seal, burst/healing ring and timecards. Small activation sparks remain on violet/mint cast poses; major effect sprites are independent. Timing and attack behavior are not part of the visual review.",
  "boss_movement_review": "Inspected original boss reference, generated boss-movement and VFX sources, and all new native frames in boss-movement.png. Manager identity and intact stopwatch match the existing boss; character poses face right with upper-left light. Walk, windup, lunge and recovery have distinct poses, no text or scenery. Dust is cream/tan; warning uses right-pointing coral chevrons. Runtime alpha, palette, bottom anchoring, distinct boss frames and warning edge matching are checked by the validator. In-game timing and corridor rendering have not been browser-tested.",
  "boss_drop_review": "Inspected all generated source sheets, compact-arm windup/release edits, every native frame in seven per-strip previews, overview and vertically repeated warning over a desk. Windup has a visibly upward-pointing index finger and one-handed watch; release points down without slamming; six jam poses keep papers attached and sweat cyan. Anatomical size calibrated per source sheet with one scale per animation. Warning stripes are faint coral with opaque thin rails and vertically matching boundaries. File stack spans 64px with stable solid body; burst bottom-anchored. Explicit ! hazard pictogram is permitted by the supplied request; no words, labels or watermarks in runtime art. Browser animation playback and in-game integration are not part of this review."
}
